sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: Reserved<br>Simulates a reservation for a specified EVSE
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a<br>Memory State: N/a<br>Reusable State(s): N/a

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Trigger the CSMS to send a ReserveNowRequest for specific EVSE

    CSMS->>CS: ReserveNowRequest (evseId = Specified evseId, idToken)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: evseId must be Specified evseId<br>connectorType must be omitted<br>idToken.idToken = Configured valid_idtoken_idtoken<br>idToken.type = Configured valid_idtoken_type

    CS-->>CSMS: ReserveNowResponse (status = Accepted)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Step 3: Test System notifies the CSMS about the current state<br>of the connector(s) of the Specified EVSE<br>Step 4: CSMS responds accordingly

    CS->>CSMS: StatusNotificationRequest (connectorStatus = Reserved)
    CSMS-->>CS: StatusNotificationResponse

    CS->>CSMS: NotifyEventRequest (trigger = Delta, actualValue = "Reserved", component.name = "Connector", variable.name = "AvailabilityState")
    CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEventResponse

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post condition: State is Reserved
